        "book": "Ecclesiastes",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And so I saw the wicked buried, who had come and gone from the place of the holy, and they were forgotten in the city where they had so done: this is also vanity.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 147,
